%[text] # **START\_HERE\_EXERCISE:**  An Electromechanical Robot arm
%[text] In this Exercise we'll build from scratch a **Simscape** model of an Electromechanical Robot arm.
%[text]  The system that we're going to explore is shown below:
%[text:table]{"ignoreHeader":true}
%[text] | <p>*NOTE:  the following image was generated by Microsoft CoPilot*</p><p>![](text:image:1be1)</p> |
%[text] | --- |
%[text:table]
%[text] 
%[text:tableOfContents]{"heading":"Table of Contents"}
%[text] `Bradley Horton : 18-Nov-2026, bhorton@mathworks.com`
%%
%[text] ## So what will the final result look like ?
%[text] By the end of this Exercise, your final model will look something like this:
