%[text] ## What if you've never used Simulink OR Simscape before ?
%[text] ### Part 1:  Navigating a Simulink model
%[text] If you're NEW to Simulink, I'd recommend that you spend 30 seconds reviewing the following document - it gives some basic background on how to "navigate" a Simulink model:
%[text] -  [`bh_SL_navigation_BASICS.mlx`](<matlab:  open bh_SL_navigation_BASICS.mlx>) \
