%[text] ## The TASKS that we'll cover today.
%[text] - [`TASK_00_model_params.mlx`](<matlab:  open  TASK_00_model_params.mlx>) **`:`** We'll define **parameters** for our models
%[text] - [`TASK_01_create_mechanical_arm.mlx`](<matlab:  open   TASK_01_create_mechanical_arm.mlx>) **`:`** We'll model the **Mechanical Robot arm**
%[text] - [`TASK_02_add_a_gearbox.mlx`](<matlab:  open  TASK_02_add_a_gearbox.mlx>) **`:`** We'll connect a **Gearbox** to the Mechanical Robot arm
%[text] - [`TASK_03_add_a_DC_motor.mlx`](<matlab:  open  TASK_03_add_a_DC_motor.mlx>) **`:`** We'll add a **DC Motor** and **H-Bridge** circuit to the model
%[text] - [`TASK_04_design_a_PID_controller.mlx`](<matlab:  open  TASK_04_design_a_PID_controller.mlx>) **`:`** We'll design a continuous time **PID Controller** to control the complete Electromechanical system  \

